Token Monitor's own code is intentionally limited to cross-device ledger
transport, encryption/pairing, provider-route enrichment, static dashboard
presentation, and thin adapters around the upstream accounting engines.
No raw prompt, response, reasoning text, source code, project content, full
session transcript, API key, or GitHub credential is uploaded by Token Monitor.
